# PROVISIONAL — CANON REVIEW REQUIRED: Trial Aide, Trial Keeper, and all lines below.
~ trial_aide
Trial Aide: The lower hall is ready. You may take the trial, or show that you already understand its purpose.
- "Read the trial's intent and ask to pass." [#tag=INSIGHT] [if not GameState.get_flag("tutorial_gauntlet_complete") and not GameState.get_flag("tutorial_aide_skip_failed") and check("insight", 40) /]
	do SkillCheck.resolve("insight")
	if SkillCheck.last_check_succeeded()
		do GameState.set_flag("tutorial_gauntlet_complete", true)
		Trial Aide: You understand. Go through; the keeper will not bar you.
		=> END
	else
		do GameState.set_flag("tutorial_aide_skip_failed", true)
		Trial Aide: Not yet. Take the hall and learn what it asks.
		=> END
- "I will take the trial."
	Trial Aide: Then begin with the lever. Every later choice depends on what you notice here.
	=> END

~ trial_skill_door
Trial Aide: The latch accepts the stamped key from the alcove, but a careful hand can read its catch.
- "Work the catch by touch." [#tag=SLEIGHT OF HAND] [if GameState.get_flag("tutorial_warden_cleared") and not GameState.get_flag("tutorial_skill_door_open") and not GameState.get_flag("tutorial_skill_door_check_failed") and check("sleight_of_hand", 40) /]
	do SkillCheck.resolve("sleight_of_hand")
	if SkillCheck.last_check_succeeded()
		do GameState.set_flag("tutorial_skill_door_open", true)
		Trial Aide: The catch lifts. The keeper waits beyond.
		=> END
	else
		do GameState.set_flag("tutorial_skill_door_check_failed", true)
		Trial Aide: The catch binds. The key in the alcove remains your way through.
		=> END
- "Use the stamped key." [if GameState.get_flag("tutorial_skill_door_open") /]
	Trial Aide: The latch is open.
	=> END
- "Leave the latch alone."
	=> END

~ trial_keeper
Trial Keeper: One choice remains. Convince me to stand aside, or meet me in the trial.
- "No blood is needed; yielding proves the same lesson." [#tag=PERSUASION] [if not GameState.get_flag("tutorial_gauntlet_complete") and not GameState.get_flag("tutorial_keeper_talk_failed") and check("persuasion", 40) /]
	do SkillCheck.resolve("persuasion")
	if SkillCheck.last_check_succeeded()
		do GameState.set_flag("tutorial_gauntlet_complete", true)
		Trial Keeper: Enough. Pass into Dom.
		=> END
	else
		do GameState.set_flag("tutorial_keeper_talk_failed", true)
		Trial Keeper: Words alone have not carried you through.
		=> END
- "Fight me, then." [if not GameState.get_flag("tutorial_gauntlet_complete") /]
	do GameState.set_flag("tutorial_keeper_fight_requested", true)
	Trial Keeper: Then stand ready.
	=> END
- "I need a moment."
	=> END
